sequenceDiagram
    participant USER as User
    participant SRC1 as Client System
    participant SRC2 as HR Data Source
    participant PM as Project Management
    participant SQL as Metadata Store (Azure SQL)
    participant COSMOS as Metadata Store (Cosmos DB)
    participant INGEST as Data Ingestion
    participant CONC as Conclude

    USER->>PM: 1. Project Data
    SRC1-->>PM: 2. Client, Entity
    SRC2-->>PM: 3. Global Employees Data
    
    Note right of PM: Process project setup<br/>and engagement data

    PM->>INGEST: 4. Project Data, Engagement Rollforward
    PM->>CONC: 5. Engagement, Client, Entity
    
    %% Split flow from Project Management
    PM->>SQL: 6. Primary Project Records
    PM->>COSMOS: 7. Extended Engagement Config
    
    %% Flows from other nodes hitting stores individually
    INGEST->>SQL: 8. Ingested Metadata (Status/Logs)
    CONC->>SQL: 9. Project Wrap-up Data

    Note over PM,INGEST: Project established, ready for data ingestion